{"unit_id":"StarMoon-win__dsh-restart-plugin#card-zh","repo":"StarMoon-win/dsh-restart-plugin","commit":"d90f8dab2fd385356851e03adc2986f2a970db73","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-restart-desktop 为 Windows 桌面版 DSH 的侧边栏添加完整重启按钮。它通过侧边栏操作槽显示按钮，并由 Host 路由启动独立助手，结束当前桌面应用后重新打开。功能包括检测是否支持、发起重启、显示处理中或失败状态，以及重启失败后重新开放操作。适合希望从 DSH 侧边栏直接重启 Windows 桌面应用的用户。需要 Windows 桌面版 DSH 和系统 PowerShell。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:70-153","index.js:126-166","helper.mjs:171-206"]}
{"unit_id":"StarMoon-win__dsh-restart-plugin#card-en","repo":"StarMoon-win/dsh-restart-plugin","commit":"d90f8dab2fd385356851e03adc2986f2a970db73","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-restart-desktop adds a sidebar restart button for Windows DSH desktop. A Host route starts a detached helper to stop and relaunch the app. The button shows status, and the helper retries failed launches and logs progress. Requires Windows DSH desktop and PowerShell.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:70-153","index.js:126-166","helper.mjs:171-206"]}
